# .tool-versions — single source of truth for tool versions (US-V4-11, FR-V4-45)
#
# Consumed by:
#   - GitHub Actions CI/CD via jdx/mise-action (terraform-ci.yml, terraform-apply.yml)
#   - Local developers via mise (https://mise.jdx.dev) or asdf (https://asdf-vm.com)
#   - Pre-commit hooks (.pre-commit-config.yaml) via mise-resolved binaries
#
# Bumping rules (FR-V4-45..49):
#   - Dependabot does NOT track .tool-versions; bumps are operator-driven via PR
#     touching this file only. Tag comments below are advisory hints, not pins.
#   - No other file in the repo may declare these tool versions. Adding e.g.
#     `TF_VERSION: ...` to a workflow is a regression caught by
#     scripts/validate-tool-version-singleton.py in CI.
#   - asdf/mise format is `<plugin> <version>`, one tool per line.

terraform   1.5.7        # ADR-029-v3 pin (~> 1.5.0); paired with terraform/provider.tf required_version
tflint      0.55.0       # CI tflint + pre-commit local hook
checkov     3.2.345      # consumed by CI checkov job + pre-commit terraform_checkov hook
terragrunt  0.67.0       # provisioning helper (not yet wired into CI; pinned for future use)
kubectl     1.31.3       # cluster-access helper for cutover/runbook scripts
kustomize   5.4.3        # kustomize-render parity with ArgoCD (kustomize.buildOptions)
